    <content:encoded>[caption id="attachment_1300" align="aligncenter" width="640"]&lt;a href="http://flyingsummers.com/wp-content/uploads/2010/08/doggone.png"&gt;&lt;img class="size-full wp-image-1300" alt="Survived the Flight" src="http://flyingsummers.com/wp-content/uploads/2010/08/doggone.png" width="640" height="480" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt; Survived the Flight[/caption]

N3989L managed to bring home Kylee, a dog for Ellie's birthday. Usually the dog is carsick and Adam was a little worried about the interior of the plane, but the flight went okay. Kylee is a rescue dog. On arrival at Adam's house the dog took off for a night away, which convinced her that the warm house was a better alternative.</content:encoded>
